<title>USA: American United Global stake cut by group.</title>
<headline>American United Global stake cut by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Associated Capital LP said Tuesday it reduced its stake in American United Global Inc to 4.9 percent or 356,500 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently sold 131,300 shares of the Downey,Calif.-based company between March 4 and April 7 at $4.25 to $6.00 each.</p>
